  m_text: "Roles are customizable! Game hosts can choose how many times an Engineer
    can vent, Shapeshifter cooldown, etc. They can also pick the percentage chance
    of one of these roles occurring in the game. You can always see if a role is
    turned on in the game lobby settings!\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
